---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Icon from "../layouts/components/Icon.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---

<PageLayout
  name="About"
  nameZh="关于我们"
  description="Learn about Particle Intelligence and its vision for particle research and microfluidic design."
  descriptionZh="了解 Particle Intelligence 的愿景，以及颗粒研究和微流控设计方向。"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="about-intro">
        <span class="eyebrow" data-zh="我们的故事">
          OUR STORY
        </span>
        <h1 data-zh="以共同的好奇心，探索颗粒运动。">
          A shared curiosity about particles in motion.
        </h1>
        <p
          class="page-lead"
          data-zh="Particle Intelligence 是一个处于早期阶段的研究与创业筹备项目，关注物理、实验科学和人工智能在颗粒行为研究中的交汇。该项目尚未注册为公司。"
        >
          Particle Intelligence is an early-stage research and entrepreneurial
          initiative exploring particle behavior through physics, experiments,
          and artificial intelligence. The initiative is not yet incorporated.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="story-layout">
        <article class="story-copy">
          <span class="story-kicker" data-zh="共同的研究兴趣">
            SHARED RESEARCH INTERESTS
          </span>
          <p data-zh="创始团队的背景涵盖微流控与颗粒输运、人工智能、生物力学和金融。我们对颗粒系统的共同兴趣，构成了这个项目的出发点。">
            The founders bring backgrounds in microfluidics and particle
            transport, artificial intelligence, biomechanics, and finance. A
            shared interest in particle systems is the starting point for this
            initiative.
          </p>
          <p data-zh="Phora 是这一长期愿景中的研究概念：探索物理建模、机器学习与实验观察如何帮助理解颗粒运动。这里展示的是研究兴趣和可能的未来方向，不代表已经验证或可供使用的商业产品。">
            Phora is a research concept within that long-term vision: exploring
            how physical modeling, machine learning, and experimental
            observations could inform our understanding of particle motion. This
            site presents research interests and possible future directions,
            rather than a validated or available commercial product.
          </p>
        </article>

        <aside class="story-vision">
          <span class="story-kicker" data-zh="我们的长期方向">
            OUR LONG-TERM DIRECTION
          </span>
          <h2 data-zh="预测。设计。学习。">Predict. Design. Learn.</h2>
          <ol class="story-steps">
            <li>
              <span>01</span>
              <span data-zh="预测颗粒行为">Predict particle behavior</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>02</span>
              <span data-zh="设计可检验的实验">
                Design testable experiments
              </span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>03</span>
              <span data-zh="从结果中学习">Learn from results</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p data-zh="这一长期愿景仍需进一步研究与验证。">
            This long-term vision requires further research and validation.
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <section class="founders-section" aria-labelledby="founders-title">
        <div class="founders-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow" data-zh="创始团队">
            THE FOUNDING TEAM
          </span>
          <h2 id="founders-title" data-zh="认识我们的团队">
            Meet the team
          </h2>
          <p data-zh="了解创始团队的学术背景、过往经历与研究兴趣。">
            Meet the founders and learn about their academic backgrounds, prior
            experience, and research interests.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-grid">
          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="联合创始人">
              CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Daniel Zhong</h3>
            <p data-zh="Daniel Zhong 是 Particle Intelligence 的联合创始人，毕业于 University of Pennsylvania。">
              Daniel Zhong is a Co-Founder of Particle Intelligence and a
              graduate of the University of Pennsylvania.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="联合创始人 | 博士研究人员">
              Co-Founder | Ph.D. Researcher
            </span>
            <h3>Langqi Xing</h3>
            <p data-zh="Langqi Xing 是 Northeastern University 机械工程博士研究人员，拥有 UC Santa Barbara 化学工程背景。五年多的研究经历中，他专长于软物质物理、微流控、颗粒输运和计算建模，并发表了多篇同行评审论文。他的研究兴趣包括结合输运物理、实验科学与人工智能，理解颗粒系统。">
              Langqi Xing is a Ph.D. researcher in Mechanical Engineering at
              Northeastern University with a background in Chemical Engineering
              from UC Santa Barbara. With over five years of research
              experience, he specializes in soft matter physics, microfluidics,
              particle transport, and computational modeling. His work has
              resulted in multiple peer-reviewed publications. His research
              interests include the integration of transport physics,
              experimental science, and artificial intelligence for
              understanding particle-based systems.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="联合创始人">
              CO-FOUNDER
            </span>
            <h3>Chunyang Li</h3>
            <p data-zh="Chunyang Li 是 Particle Intelligence 的联合创始人，拥有金融与商业分析背景。在 HSBC Securities Services 任职期间，他管理过每年 300 万美元的技术预算，并建立五年期现金流折现模型，比较平台全面替换与定向升级方案。他评估了实施延迟、供应商定价和采用速度对净现值与回收期的影响，建议优先实施回收期较短且在较慢采用情景下仍保持正净现值的升级方案。他还曾在 UNIQLO China 从事商业分析，拥有 Brandeis International Business School 商业分析硕士学位及 Yonsei University 国际商务学士学位。">
              Chunyang Li is a Co-Founder of Particle Intelligence with a
              background in finance and business analytics. At HSBC Securities
              Services, he managed a US$3 million annual technology budget and
              built a five-year discounted cash flow model comparing a platform
              replacement with a targeted upgrade. He assessed how
              implementation delays, vendor pricing, and slower adoption
              affected net present value and payback, and recommended the
              shorter-payback upgrade that retained positive NPV under slower
              adoption. His background also includes commercial analytics at
              UNIQLO China, an M.S. in Business Analytics from Brandeis
              International Business School, and a B.A. in International
              Commerce from Yonsei University.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="联合创始人 | 博士研究人员">
              Co-Founder | Ph.D. Researcher
            </span>
            <h3>Ruize Hou</h3>
            <p data-zh="Ruize Hou 的研究兴趣包括机器学习、深度学习及科学人工智能应用，研究涵盖预测建模、时间序列分析和复杂工程系统的数据驱动方法。他目前在 Northeastern University 攻读工业工程博士，拥有 Cornell University 硕士学位，曾在 Emory University 学习应用数学与统计，并在 Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute 学习数学。">
              Ruize Hou’s research interests include machine learning, deep
              learning, and scientific AI applications. His research spans
              predictive modeling, time series analysis, and data-driven
              approaches to complex engineering systems. He is pursuing a Ph.D.
              in Industrial Engineering at Northeastern University and holds a
              master’s degree from Cornell University. He studied Applied
              Mathematics and Statistics at Emory University and Mathematics at
              Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute (RPI).
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="founder-card">
            <span class="founder-role" data-zh="联合创始人 | 博士研究人员">
              Co-Founder | Ph.D. Researcher
            </span>
            <h3>Yeqing Ni</h3>
            <p data-zh="Yeqing Ni 是 Northeastern University 机械工程博士研究人员，拥有 Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute 机械工程学士学位和 Columbia University 机械工程硕士学位。他的生物力学研究结合有限元分析、计算建模和科学编程，使用基于 MRI 的人体头部模型及 Ansys LS-DYNA 研究固有振型、受迫振动响应和头部损伤力学。他还使用 COMSOL Multiphysics 建立脑肿瘤药物递送模型，并通过血脑屏障细胞系和弥漫性内生型脑桥胶质瘤相关的体外实验进行验证；此外，他使用 MATLAB、Python 和 Fortran 建立冠脉血流 0D–3D 模型。其工程经验还包括数值求解器开发、耐久性测试、数据分析，以及 Abaqus、SolidWorks 和 SimVascular。">
              Yeqing Ni is a Ph.D. researcher in Mechanical Engineering at
              Northeastern University. He earned a bachelor’s degree in
              Mechanical Engineering from Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute and a
              master’s degree in the same field from Columbia University. His
              biomechanics research combines finite element analysis,
              computational modeling, and scientific programming. Using
              MRI-based human head models in Ansys LS-DYNA, he studies natural
              vibration modes, forced vibration response, and head injury
              mechanics. He has also modeled drug delivery to brain tumors in
              COMSOL Multiphysics and conducted in vitro validation with
              blood–brain barrier cell lines and diffuse intrinsic pontine
              glioma. In addition, he has built 0D–3D coronary blood flow models
              using MATLAB, Python, and Fortran. His broader engineering
              experience includes numerical solver development, durability
              testing, data analysis, Abaqus, SolidWorks, and SimVascular.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="contact-cta">
        <div>
          <h2 data-zh="交流研究背景与想法？">
            Interested in the ideas behind the initiative?
          </h2>
          <p data-zh="欢迎围绕颗粒科学开展学术交流与一般咨询。">
            We welcome academic discussion and general inquiries about particle
            science.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={withBase("/contact/")}>
          <span data-zh="联系我们">Contact us</span>
          <Icon name="arrow" size={18} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about-intro {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 38px;
  }
  .about-intro h1 {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 12px 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 64px);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .about-intro .page-lead {
    max-width: 740px;
  }
  .story-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(280px, 0.75fr);
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .story-copy,
  .story-vision {
    padding: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 38px);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface, #fff);
  }
  .story-copy p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .story-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .story-kicker {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }
  .story-vision h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 20px;
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .story-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 11px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .story-steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .story-steps li > span:first-child {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .story-vision > p {
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .founders-section {
    margin-top: 76px;
  }
  .founders-heading {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .founders-heading h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .founders-heading p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .founder-card {
    padding: 27px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--surface, #fff);
  }
  .founder-card:last-child {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .founder-card:last-child p {
    max-width: 980px;
  }
  .founder-role {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .founder-card h3 {
    margin: 15px 0 12px;
    font-size: 21px;
  }
  .founder-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .founders-section {
      margin-top: 64px;
    }
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .founder-card:last-child {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
